{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":42369,\"title\":\"Custe o Que Custar\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Custe o Que Custar is a Brazilian television comedy show, produced by Eyeworks and aired weekly by Rede Bandeirantes since March 17, 2008. It is presented by Marcelo Tas, and has in its team Marco Luque and Oscar Filho. The news reports are conducted by Felipe Andreoli, Monica Iozzi, Mauricio Meirelles, Ronald Rios and Dani Calabresa.\\n\\nThe program covers weekly events from Politics, Arts and Sports, from a humorous and satirical viewpoint. It oftens uses metalanguage by satyrizing the very program on live transmissions, and introducing graphics and sound effects from the subjects.\\n\\nThe format comes from Argentina, when it was originated under the name Caiga Quien Caiga, created in 1995 by Mario Pergolini\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uH08SCmg1v4v7hFACNYhPaeCdAq.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jX5pyRqoezxdZ1nlDCiBIx33DGC.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":5,\"year\":2008,\"genres\":[\"News\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":8,\"totalEpisodes\":8,\"createdBy\":[\"Mario Pergolini\",\"Diego Guebel\"],\"networks\":[\"Band\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"BR\",\"name\":\"Brazil\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2015-03-09\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3392705,\"name\":\"Erick Krominski\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3392706,\"name\":\"Juliano Dip\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1137428,\"name\":\"Marco Luque\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cGslk3faypmrZJgpdicuHHFG3QF.jpg\"},{\"id\":1862968,\"name\":\"Rafael Cortez\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lk3HL8lXOBKze7Xm0GnfQKrl6uF.jpg\"},{\"id\":550453,\"name\":\"Dan Stulbach\",\"character\":\"apresentador\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7h3JTwgiUrWjnsznQ5V7CfnaA2